# The read must FAIL: Surelog reports the three ILLEGAL lines in dut.sv --
# a range bound whose value has x bits (UH0740) and two calls with the wrong
# number of arguments (UH0741: one argument too many, one required formal
# left out).  The exact count pins it to those lines: the defaulted formal
# left out, the zero-argument call and the x-valued DATA parameter must
# stay silent.
logger -expect error "Surelog reported 0 fatal, 0 syntax and 3 other error" 1
read_sv -nonote -noinfo -nowarning dut.sv
